384	     * {@code "FY<YY>"}. The fiscal year starts on 1 July: a registration date on or after 1 July
385	     * belongs to that calendar year's fiscal year, an earlier date belongs to the previous year's,
386	     * and {@code YY} is the last two digits of the year the fiscal year started (e.g. a date in
387	     * August 2026 yields {@code "FY26"}, a date in March 2026 yields {@code "FY25"}).
388	     *
