411	    /**
412	     * The owner's membership number formatted as {@code "<customerCode>-M<YY>"}, where
413	     * {@code YY} is the last two digits of the registration date's fiscal year (the same fiscal
414	     * year returned by {@link #getFiscalYear()}, e.g. {@code "NSW-1A2B3C4D-M26"}).
